OL,3,GNEWSAChannel biometric border checks
OL,4,Aface more delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew European Union biometric border
OL,7,Fchecks planned for the Port of Dover
OL,8,Fmay face further delays, the BBC has
OL,9,Flearned.
OL,11,FThe technology, which takes the
OL,12,Ffingerprints and photos of non-EU
OL,13,Fcitizens, was proposed in April 2016
OL,14,Fand began its roll out in October 2025,
OL,15,Fwith countries allowed flexibility to
OL,16,Fsuspend the system in cases of long
OL,17,Fqueues or technical problems.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
