OL,3,GNEWSAChannel biometric border checks
OL,4,Aface more delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FOctober 2026 was supposed to see its
OL,7,Ffull implementation but the French
OL,8,FMinistry of the Interior has confirmed
OL,9,F"flexibility is being granted" until
OL,10,Fthe end of 2026.
OL,12,FThe European Commission has declined to
OL,13,Fcomment.
